---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy | Water Damage Restoration Ellicott City MD';
const description = 'Privacy policy for waterdamagerestorationellicottcitymd.us explaining how we handle information collected through our website.';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="space-y-6 text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
        <p>Last updated: November 2025</p>
        <p>This privacy policy describes how Water Damage Restoration Ellicott City MD (“we,” “us,” or “our”) collects, uses, and protects information when you visit waterdamagerestorationellicottcitymd.us or contact us through the site.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you use our contact form, we collect the name, email address, phone number (if provided), and message content you submit. We may also collect standard technical information such as IP address and browser type through normal web server logs.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900">How We Use Information</h2>
        <p>We use the information you provide to respond to your inquiries, schedule services, and improve our website and communication. We do not sell your personal information.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Form Submissions</h2>
        <p>Our contact form is processed through Web3Forms. Information submitted is used solely to respond to your request. Please review Web3Forms’ own privacy practices if you have questions about their processing.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Cookies and Analytics</h2>
        <p>We may use basic analytics tools that set cookies to understand how visitors use the site. You can control cookies through your browser settings.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>Our site may contain links to external websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, please contact us through the form on our <a href="/contact" class="text-primary hover:underline">Contact page</a> or by phone at (410) 555-0199.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Changes</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The “Last updated” date at the top will reflect the most recent revision.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
